{"server":"cn","storyId":"act11mini_level_act11mini_st05","groupId":"act11mini","stageId":null,"title":"和而不同","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act11mini/level_act11mini_st05.txt","sourceHash":"3d89853865ee7454ac0f15475d16c65f27d81afbf05228d7cb963d342744f013","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"已经十点半了，喝咖啡？你现在还有闲心喝咖啡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"把你的屁股从咖啡机旁的椅子上挪到你的办公桌前面来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"上回提的意见你改得怎么样了？现在到下午三点的会可没多长时间了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"方案已经改好了，在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"之前会上给的意见很清楚，基本上当场就给了几个解决思路，改起来很顺利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"讲稿也准备好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"时间不多了，从今天算起再到周末，三天，方案要定下来，还要给后面部门留实施的时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"多仔细点，市长的意思很清楚，这次和之前不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"火山不等人，我这句话可不是在开玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯，明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"让我看看你写的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"给，是这一份，讲稿是附在下面的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"......那个......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"......其实我做这份方案的时候，一直觉得有个问题我们内部无法解决，需要在会上提出来让老大和市长谈才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"什么问题？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"我不太确定，我先讲一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，这次搬迁，我们给出的方案是分区块迁移模式，先去的是各地块的关键技术人员和重要岗位的管理人员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"这群人的人数在我们的能力范围内，已经全部迁移完成，等他们再完成了核心地区的接管后，我们就可以开始准备迁入剩下的人口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"不变的需求是以区块为单位，依次迁入，但，目前给出的几个方案，即便联络外地的物流公司，运力也肯定是不够的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。所以呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"光有想法约等于没有，发现问题了你的对策是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"总不是想等着会上提出来让行政和运输局那边给你解决吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......单单几家物流公司的运力肯定不够......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现代物流公司专业的运输管理能力......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是汐斯塔市政府，我是市长赫尔曼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"市长先生，打扰一下，我来和您确认一下今天的日程安排。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"这是日程表。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"以上是之前已经定好的日程。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"需要您判断的是，我刚刚接到物流合作方来电，他将会在下午一点左右到达汐斯塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"您下午原定的日程有三点的与各部门商讨人口迁入的会议，根据各部门排期表来看并不方便延迟，取消会议的可能性不大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"需要我代您出席会议吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你跟着我去见合作方，会议找另一个秘书和他们先开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让他做好会议记录，结束后交给我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"与物流合作方商讨这件事需要和各部门同步一下吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可以先说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但只说也许能和外国物流公司合作，成功的话会考虑引进新的物流管理模式，要在会中就给出一个新的方案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，我这就去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的，目前是这个状态。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"市长先生下午将会和客户商讨，下午的会议主题参考我刚才所说，这是文件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"以上是市长先生通过我传递的消息。你们还有什么问题吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"没有了，辛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢您。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"小子，从现在开始，你还有四个小时。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"您看，这是我之前准备的另一份方案，关于引进新的物流管理模式的合作意向书。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，你小子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"给你说个好消息，这次工作完成得好，每人都能领到一笔奖金。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"好好干！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"市长先生，您好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"非常感谢您的联络，以及，我很荣幸能有这次的合作机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"合作本就是双方受益的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是您的儿子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，带他历练历练，不趁早见见世面，以后难成气候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"市长先生您好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"初次见面，一只腕表，这是给市长先生的礼物——只是出于我个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢。只是现在收下来自峯驰物流的礼物，于公于私，都不适合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欧厄尔先生，之前的项目需求已经在电话中和您沟通完毕，今天邀请您来到汐斯塔，就是希望我们能在合同上达成一致。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，市长先生果然雷厉风行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"市政府之前发来的项目书我们已经看过了，相比之下，以峯驰物流的体量和能力，能和市政府直接合作，我们十分感谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，市政府也很珍惜这次合作的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，峯驰物流对合同怎么看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"市长先生是爽快人，峯驰物流当然很愿意签下这份合同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，既然是双方合作共赢，在报价这一方面，我们希望可以再讨论一番。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这只腕表——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"市长先生可以随时停止它的时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"峯驰物流胃口不小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈，市长先生误会了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"峯驰物流的意思是，我们或许可以无偿提供这次帮助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您说说看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"市长先生可以看看这个，这是峯驰物流拟定的《项目承包意向书》。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟这次是和市政府直接合作，我们当然希望这次合作可以更进一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们希望，峯驰物流可以借这次机会，在汐斯塔建立一个以峯驰为主导的，不会受本地物流或者信使制约的新的物流公司。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说得好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我也相信欧厄尔先生清楚您这句话的分量。"},{"type":"narration","text":"赫尔曼将后背轻靠在了椅背上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"......咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"市长先生，您原定三点的会议即将开始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"市长先生的秘书反应很快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欧厄尔先生，挑选一位秘书并不只看这个人的能力，还要看他能不能理解我的意思，也要看他适不适合这个场合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"市政府总有很多选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但市长先生明知道远水解不了近渴，却还是选择了舍近求远。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三点的会议时间马上就要到了，您看——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"峯驰物流还有什么要展示给我们的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"市长先生，若是我说峯驰物流两个都能做到呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"峯驰物流不是为了赚钱才来的，我们是为了解决问题来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您认为的“问题”是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"市长有什么问题我就帮您解决什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有什么问题？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"转型。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以峯驰物流为主的新物流公司建立完毕后，市长先生可以借物流之力支持自由贸易，以不属任何政治实体的立场建立贸易协定网络——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将来，汐斯塔能在贸易协定下，以中立身份进入各国市场，成为一个足以支援各地政府及企业的商务活动枢纽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，感谢您，峯驰物流很有远见。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"秘书上前一步，准备接过赫尔曼向后递来的文件。\n欧厄尔向前倾斜了身子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"市长先生觉得，哥伦比亚的拓荒商业模式如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提卡伦多终年环绕着哥伦比亚行驶，它为哥伦比亚带来持续不断的经济效益。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提卡伦多？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提卡伦多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样一座以拓荒为主的贸易之城，它的未来只在哥伦比亚为它规划的范围之内。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拓荒城市向来与其他移动城市不同，更与汐斯塔不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但相同的是，它为哥伦比亚带来的直接利益，远大于其相对独立的地位带来的潜在麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以提卡伦多会一直这样移动下去，在荒地上获得其他移动城市得不到的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欧厄尔先生能明白吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何况您才是汐斯塔的市长，汐斯塔还是您说了算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，提卡伦多的经济模式已经定型，未来也不会变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"汐斯塔现在要搬离这片美丽的沙滩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等离开后，谁说了算？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，市长先生，您知道，大炎与这里相隔万里，即使有着现代的交通方式，这仍旧是一段不短的距离。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"峯驰物流只是一家远在龙门的私人企业，做不了什么大事。既然您邀请了，我们就来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"市长先生可以看看这个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即便峯驰一直以来只在龙门及其周边做生意，但赚的钱向来不是小数目。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它可以让我知道，火山留给汐斯塔的时间，甚至等不到这个小子结婚生子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"机会难得，时间不等人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怪不得欧厄尔先生要送腕表。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"赫尔曼看向坐在桌子后方的拜松。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的儿子对这个提案有什么看法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的儿子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"我吗？市长先生，我并没有参与这次......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，没什么，只是随口一问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你希望我们谈成今天这份合同吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......作为峯驰物流的执行经理，我自然是希望的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"市长先生，虽然我没有参与这次的项目，但我清楚，物流公司的未来发展方向必然不会仅仅拘泥于物资的转运，更是经济和文化的交流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"我们有想法，有能力，相信我们不会让您失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"市长先生，您觉得呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的一个女儿也是为汐斯塔想了很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在她和我另一个女儿离开这里之前，我答应了她，会向着她心目中汐斯塔未来的发展方向努力。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"移动城市汐斯塔，它会是一个很美的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，辛苦您为了这项合同所做的努力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，太阳快落山了，这时候的景色最好看，我们出去聊聊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_beach_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店主A","speakerId":"avg_npc_022","isRemote":false,"text":"这是剩下的最后一点了，把这些存货卖完之后，我们也就收拾东西准备搬到新城区里吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店主B","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"还真有点舍不得呢......我从小就在这里长大，这里的每粒沙子我都认得......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店主B","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"走之前我一定要带一瓶沙子，以后还不知道能不能回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店主B","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"肯定不能了吧......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店主A","speakerId":"avg_npc_022","isRemote":false,"text":"说不定呢？别这么伤心嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店主A","speakerId":"avg_npc_022","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，有人过来了，快招呼一下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店主A","speakerId":"avg_npc_022","isRemote":false,"text":"您好~特色炭烤沙虫腿！小店马上要搬迁了，以后可能就出新菜单了，这是能吃到的最后几天啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"这、这是什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"沙虫......腿？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么咋咋呼呼的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......市长先生，汐斯塔除了风景一绝，食物也是与众不同啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，之前黑曜石节的时候，有个小姑娘在这里卖了这种烧烤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家吃着都觉得不错，现在似乎已经是一种流行小吃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店主A","speakerId":"avg_npc_022","isRemote":false,"text":"（欸，这是市长吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店主B","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"（你问我，我见过市长真人吗？我每天见的人和你不一样啊？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店主A","speakerId":"avg_npc_022","isRemote":false,"text":"（我们要不要......？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店主B","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"（我觉得我们还是正常点吧......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店主B","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈，这几位客人要尝尝吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......还是算了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过市长先生......那边一直转的设施是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个吗？是“旋转驮兽”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它也是黑曜石节上突然兴起的一个设施，不知道出于什么原因，那几天每天都有大批大批的人一直来玩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店主A","speakerId":"avg_npc_022","isRemote":false,"text":"几位都是外地人吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店主A","speakerId":"avg_npc_022","isRemote":false,"text":"送您一根，尝尝看吧！要是觉得好吃了再来买！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，谢谢您。那我再买一根吧，给您钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店主A","speakerId":"avg_npc_022","isRemote":false,"text":"小伙子好有礼貌，长得也挺可爱的嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？......谢谢您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店主B","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店主B","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"我还在旁边呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店主A","speakerId":"avg_npc_022","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_beach_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"市长先生，欧厄尔先生，这里请。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看着海景用餐，在汐斯塔是一件颇受游客喜欢的事，这里的风景最好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在搬迁后，汐斯塔也会继续保留这方面的特色，即便到了移动城市上，也不会失去它原本就有的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自然不会失去，市长先生思考得很周全。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"服务生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您的菜上齐了，请慢用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，美景配美食，生鳞片别有一番滋味。市长先生，方才我听到，那两个店主在讨论搬迁以后要出什么新菜单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做小商贩也有很多事情要考虑啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沙滩上还有一些娱乐设施没有撤走，欧厄尔先生可以让自己的儿子去体验体验。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢市长先生。我在这里继续陪着就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欧厄尔先生的儿子似乎年纪并不大，倒是很稳重。寻常这个年纪的孩子，早就拉着自己的家长要去买门票了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，他啊，我是想让他继承峯驰物流，或者看他自己的打算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来欧厄尔先生是早有计划，对他从小培养。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目光长远。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪里，您也能看出来，他现在还嫩着呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且只是现在看着稳重罢了，他小时候，没少让我操心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欧厄尔先生谦虚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"市长先生，这可真就不是谦虚了，我相信为人父都可能有过类似的经历，您不要笑话我接下来要说的事——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他四岁那阵，他们学校举办了个什么亲子节，我去参加了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去了以后发现是亲子拔河比赛，他母亲身体不好，是我上去拔河......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欧厄尔先生拔河，应该没人能赢得过吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......对，这方面是没人能赢得过，我们很快就得了第一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但坏就坏在那个时候小朋友们都还不懂事，见我们赢了，他们也想赢，一股脑地跑过来抓着我的腿叫“爸爸”，想让我帮他们拔河。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您夫人......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身体的缘故，当时不在场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那还好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这小子大度得很！直接把我推出去了，说老师教他要学会分享。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我都不敢说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......爸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前市长先生提过，您是有两个女儿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两个女儿......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"赫尔曼将后背轻靠在了椅背上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个让我省心，一个一点都不让我省心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，或者说，两个都不太让我省心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，没有想到，市长先生对待孩子竟然是这样的性格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早些年，那个不让我省心的还在维多利亚上大学的时候，几乎从来没有邀请我去看过她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有一次，我抽出时间去了她的学校，想和老师谈谈她的近况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到看到她找来了一个人装成自己的父亲，和她的老师交流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您女儿胆子也很大嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她是胆子挺大的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在旁边听了许久，有些生气，但又不得不承认......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的这个女儿......温室里长出的花固然美好、艳丽，但我希望她可以是温室里的野草。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能做出这种事情来，她确实是我的亲生女儿。我也能相信她一个人在外面，有能力化解自己遇到的难处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何况，她看人的眼光还不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以后来，我派人联系了那个假扮我的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很好奇您做了什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我让他来我手下做事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈，不愧是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个人也真是个人才。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"......咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，原来是您啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"不敢不敢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，真有意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那市长先生的女儿现在如何了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她们已经去工作了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，再过上一阵，我也打算把这小子丢出去，好好见识一下世面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在龙门认识几个老朋友，他们虽然胡来是胡来了点，但放这小子在他们那里，肯定不会出事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想让孩子们好好长大可真是一件难事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欧厄尔先生想来为这个孩子付出了不少心血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要说这个，我自觉比不上我的妻子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"几年以前，有着年幼的儿子，患病的妻子，那时我确实萌生过放缓公司进程的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她连写了十数封家书质问我，哈哈哈，要不是雷姆必拓与大炎相隔千里，我真的怀疑她会直接过来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有了那些信，峯驰物流才会有现在的样子，我和这小子也才有了现在的样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您真是一个幸运的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"看着眼前拍打不停的浪花，赫尔曼沉默了一会儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望您夫人的身体早日康复。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢市长先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“市长先生”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"称呼我赫尔曼就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫尔曼先生......我现在才真的觉得您也是位父亲，而不光是一位市长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，欧厄尔先生也和我想的有些不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫尔曼先生，我们来喝一杯吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维多利亚的葡萄，色泽黑红，香气浓郁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"高卢的木桶酿造，带着雪松烘烤的风味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您尝尝，这是从龙门带来的酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瞧我，喝多了，手拿不稳杯子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，洒了一点酒而已，常有的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再来给您倒一杯——只要市长先生有杯子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的杯子很久没有拿出来过了，要是手抖，再碎了怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈，我扶着您的手，杯子就不会碎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这可是拔河赢了一整个学校的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那我确实可以放心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"两人拿着酒杯，看着眼前的风景。\n夕阳西下，但是海面上升起了比白天时更灿烂耀眼的光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欧厄尔先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您讲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从龙门带来的酒，味道很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本，它是不可能来到汐斯塔的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫尔曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信除了汐斯塔，它也会合其他国家人们的口味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欧厄尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_539_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我也相信，汐斯塔会喜欢我带来的酒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_325_bison","aliases":["拜松"]}]}
